UCUM
----

src/ucum_table.rs is generated from ucum-essence.xml, the machine-readable
table of the Unified Code for Units of Measure, as bundled verbatim in the
ucum-units crate (version 0.1.0). It holds UCUM's prefix and unit codes, and
their values and definitions as UCUM writes them.

